"https://thebookofconcord.org/formula-of-concord-epitome/summary/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"125\",\"title\":\"How do Lutherans differ from other churches on the Lord's Supper?\",\"description\":\"May 1, 2017 · Though they share some teachings in common (think: Apostles' Creed), there is disagreement in others, such as conversion, the natural condition ...\",\"url\":\"https://lutheranspokesman.org/2017/05/01/how-do-lutherans-differ-from-other-churches-on-the-lords-supper/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"126\",\"title\":\"The Origins of Calvinism by Joel Beeke - Monergism |\",\"description\":\"Puritan conformists remained within the Anglican fold. Eventually, Calvinism crossed the Atlantic to the British colonies in North America, where the New ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.monergism.com/thethreshold/articles/onsite/origins.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"127\",\"title\":\"The Canons of Dort | Christian Reformed Church\",\"description\":\"Introduction. The Decision of the Synod of Dort on the Five Main Points of Doctrine in Dispute in the Netherlands is popularly known as the Canons of Dort.\",\"url\":\"https://www.crcna.org/welcome/beliefs/confessions/canons-dort\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"128\",\"title\":\"What Are the Five Points of Calvinism? - Reformation Bible College\",\"description\":\"Oct 12, 2023 · These five points offered alternative interpretations of the Reformed doctrines of election, atonement, depravity, grace, and perseverance.\",\"url\":\"https://reformationbiblecollege.org/blog/what-are-the-five-points-of-calvinism\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"129\",\"title\":\"What is the Biblical Model of Church Government?\",\"description\":\"Apr 12, 2017 · I'm a Presbyterian minister, so I believe that Presbyterianism as a form of church government is most biblical.\",\"url\":\"https://rts.edu/resources/biblical-model-church-government/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"130\",\"title\":\"An Overview of Church Polities - Tabletalk Magazine\",\"description\":\