Protestants into evangelicals, which was a change for the ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/article/how-revival-turned-protestants-into-evangelicals/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"186\",\"title\":\"Evangelicalism, Revivalism, and the Second Great Awakening\",\"description\":\"Conversion. The core of nineteenth-century evangelicalism was the experience of conversion. Conversion was compelled by a set of clear ideas about the innate ...\",\"url\":\"https://nationalhumanitiescenter.org/tserve/nineteen/nkeyinfo/nevanrev.htm\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"187\",\"title\":\"Can You Be Born Again Without 'Feeling' It? - Christianity Today\",\"description\":\"May 16, 2023 · Evangelicalism has always emphasized the necessity of personal conversion through a born-again experience in which the Holy Spirit supernaturally changes a ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.christianitytoday.com/2023/05/born-again-conversion-testimony-experience/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"188\",\"title\":\"What is evangelical theology? | GotQuestions.org\",\"description\":\"Sep 16, 2024 · Evangelicalism is a popular movement within Protestantism that emphasizes being born again and having a personal relationship with Jesus Christ.\",\"url\":\"https://www.gotquestions.org/evangelical-theology.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"189\",\"title\":\"The Evangelical Narrative | Modern Reformation\",\"description\":\"One answer is that evangelicalism as a distinct expression of Protestantism started after World War II through the efforts of leaders such as Billy Graham and ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.modernreformation.org/resources/articles/the-evangelical-narrative\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"190\",\"title\":\"'There is no such thing as the evangelical': Researchers say the ...\",\"description\":\"Sep 6, 2025 · Taken together, these three categories produce a striking figure: 937 million evangelicals worldwide—nearly one in eight people on the planet.\",\"url\":\"https://www.christiandaily.com/n