n postulated in response to negative higher criticism.\",\"url\":\"https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/themelios/article/the-chicago-statement-on-biblical-inerrancy/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"197\",\"title\":\"What is the Chicago Statement on Biblical Inerrancy? - Got Questions\",\"description\":\"Mar 31, 2023 · The Chicago Statement on Biblical Inerrancy was written to address the inerrancy of Scripture, the doctrine that the Bible is free from error.\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.gotquestions.org/Chicago-Statement-Biblical-Inerrancy.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"198\",\"title\":\"The Chicago Statement on Biblical Inerrancy (CSBI)\",\"description\":\"The CSBI, created in 1978, affirms the inerrancy of Scripture, stating it is without error in all its teaching, and is God's witness.\",\"url\":\"https://josephholden.com/chicago-statements\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"199\",\"title\":\"The Rise of Protestant Liberalism - Tabletalk Magazine\",\"description\":\"Congregationalist minister Horace Bushnell became a founder of American liberal theology. He challenged the emphasis on individual conversion propagated by the ...\",\"url\":\"https://tabletalkmagazine.com/article/2019/05/rise-protestant-liberalism/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"200\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://banneroftruth.org/us/resources/articles/2017/modernism-then-and-now/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"201\",\"title\":\"Liberal Protestantism the key - The Immanent Frame\",\"description\":\"Jan 20, 2008 · “Social Gospel” theologian Walter Rauschenbusch was deeply embedded in the German theological culture on which Lilla concentrates, but ...\",\"url\":\"https://tif.ssrc.org/2008/01/20/liberal-protestantism-the-key/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"202\",\"title\":\"The Orthodox Faith - Volume III - Church History - Twentieth Century\",\"description\":\"In the late 19th century and on into the 20th century, many conservative Protestants felt challenged, even shaken, by certain developing strands of thought ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.oca.org/orthodoxy/the-orthodox-faith/church-history/twentieth-century/protestant-fundamentalism-and-protestant-liberalism\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"203\",\"title\":\"Liberal Protestantism - Dialogue Institute\",\"description\":\"Harry Emerson Fosdick was one of the most famous liberal ministers of the early 20th Century and founder of the church. Fosdick, Harry Emerson.\",\"url\":\"https://dialogueinstitute.org/liberal-protestantism\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"204\",\"title\":\"Evangelical and liberal theology - The Gospel Coalition\",\"description\":\"There is a tendency among evangelicals to treat liberal Christians (and Roman Catholics too) with hostility and virtually as non-Christians. We find it ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/themelios/article/evangelical-and-liberal-theology/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"205\",\"title\":\"A Case Study in Liberal Protestantism Collapse\",\"description\":\"Oct 30, 2022 · Historically, Presbyterianism has one of the richest theological traditions in global Protestantism. As one example, the Westminster Shorter ...\",\"url\":\"https://washingtonstand.com/commentary/a-case-study-in-liberal-protestantism-collapse-\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"206\",\"title\":\"The Theological Crisis Of 21st Century Liberal Protestantism\",\"description\":\"May 4, 2019 · The United Methodist Church is the only historically liberal mainline Protestant denomination that retains a ban on same-sex marriage. The ...\",\"url\":\"https://issuesinperspective.com/2019/05/the-theological-crisis-of-21st-century-liberal-protestantism/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"207\",\"title\":\"Progressive Christians: Beware of Liberal Theology | ifaqtheology\",\"description\":\"Jul 15, 2022 · Liberal theology adjusts doctrines to modern claims, is not biblical, and views the Bible as not authoritative, and Jesus as a religious human, ...Missing:  perspective | Show resul