he United Church of Christ (UCC) is recognized as one of the most welcoming and affirming Christian denominations, celebrating same-sex marriages since 2005.\",\"url\":\"https://www.hrc.org/resources/stances-of-faiths-on-lgbt-issues-united-church-of-christ\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"309\",\"title\":\"A milestone reached in mainline Protestant churches' decades-old ...\",\"description\":\"May 5, 2024 · The fight to allow same-sex marriage and gay clergy has defined much of the last half-century for major mainline Protestant denominations in the US.\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://fox59.com/news/national-world/ap-us-news/ap-a-milestone-reached-in-mainline-protestant-churches-decades-old-disputes-over-lgbtq-inclusion/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"310\",\"title\":\"Evangelicals And Abortion In The 20th Century: A Hidden History?\",\"description\":\"Jul 20, 2020 · The speed and totality of evangelicals' sea-change on abortion is remarkable. But what's really astonishing is that such a huge theological, ...Missing:  divorce | Show results with:divorce\",\"url\":\"https://www.patheos.com/blogs/returntorome/2013/01/evangelicals-and-abortion-in-the-20th-century-a-hidden-history/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"311\",\"title\":\"Abortion attitudes, religious and moral beliefs, and pastoral care ...\",\"description\":\"Jul 17, 2020 · The purpose of this study is to explore Protestant religious leaders' attitudes towards abortion and their strategies for pastoral care in ...\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7367465/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"312\",\"title\":\"[PDF] Protestant – Statement on Marriage, Gender, and Sexuality\",\"description\":\"We believe that the term “marriage” has only one meaning: the uniting of one man and one woman in a single, exclusive union, as delineated in Scripture.\",\"url\":\"https://www.aflc.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/m-AFLCedit-Pages-26-38-from-SOGI-Handbook.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"313\",\"title\":